		<div id="collection_page_head">
		<h4>チョコQ アニマテイルズ　どうぶつ奇想天外！編</h4>
				<table width="100%">
		<tr><td><a href="img/amazing_060.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/amazing_060_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/anima/chocoq_amazing/img/amazing_060.jpg" --></a></td>
		</tr>
		</table>

